WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 5.9 · Internal Systems & Operations
Digital tools and the tech stack

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Use the fewest tools that work, each with an owner, security and an exit route.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Choose the process first, then the tool.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Give each tool an owner and check exports.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Turn on two-step login; use a password manager.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Separate books for charity and company, a volunteer database, a tool booking system. Remove an unused events app.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your tool list, owners, risks and changes.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
